docs {
  # WebSocket Real-Time Event Catalog & Payload Contracts

  This document specifies all **14 real-time domain events** pushed by the backend to authenticated WebSocket clients inside the standard `Envelope` (`event`, optional `channel`, `data`, `timestamp`).

  > **Type Note:** Across domain payloads in `data`, user identifiers (`sender_id`, `responder_id`, `debtor_id`, `creditor_id`, `creator_id`, `updated_by_id`, `user_id`, `winner_id`) are serialized as **JSON strings** (e.g. `"42"`), while resource IDs (`request_id`, `group_id`, `poll_id`, `draw_id`, `invite_id`, `report_id`, `settlement_id`, `*_avatar_id`) and Toman amounts are **JSON integers**.

  ---

  ## Summary Matrix

  | # | `event` | Target Audience | `Envelope.channel` | Triggering REST Endpoint |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | 1 | `friend_request.received` | Recipient user | *(omitted)* | `POST /api/v1/friendships/requests` |
  | 2 | `friend_request.responded` | Original requester | *(omitted)* | `PATCH /api/v1/friendships/requests/:id/accept` or `.../reject` |
  | 3 | `settlement.paid` | Creditor user | `group:<group_id>` | `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/settlements` |
  | 4 | `poll.created` | All active group members | `group:<group_id>` | `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/polls` |
  | 5 | `poll.closed` | All active group members | `group:<group_id>` | `PATCH /api/v1/groups/:groupID/polls/:pollID/close` |
  | 6 | `draw.created` | All active group members | `group:<group_id>` | `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/draws` |
  | 7 | `draw.result` | All active group members | `group:<group_id>` | `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/draws/:drawID/run` |
  | 8 | `checklist.updated` | All active group members | `group:<group_id>` | `POST /groups/:groupID/checklist/items`, `PUT/DELETE .../claim`, `DELETE .../items/:itemID` |
  | 9 | `admin_report.answered` | Original reporter | *(omitted)* | `PUT /api/v1/admin/reports/:id/review` *(terminal statuses)* |
  | 10 | `group.member_joined` | Active group members | `group:<group_id>` | `POST /api/v1/invites/direct/:inviteID/respond` *(accept)* or `POST /api/v1/invites/links/:token/join` |
  | 11 | `group.member_left` | Active members *(+ kicked user on kick)* | `group:<group_id>` | `DELETE /api/v1/groups/:groupID/leave` or `DELETE /api/v1/groups/:groupID/members/:memberID` |
  | 12 | `group.invite_received` | Invited user | `group:<group_id>` | `POST /api/v1/invites/direct` |
  | 13 | `token.price_updated` | All connected sessions *(Broadcast)* | *(omitted)* | `PUT /api/v1/admin/token-price` *(when price changes)* |
  | 14 | `group.announcement` | Active group members *(excluding owner)* | `group:<group_id>` | `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/announcements` |

  ---

  ## 1. Friend Request Events

  ### `friend_request.received`
  **Trigger:** `POST /api/v1/friendships/requests`
  **Recipient:** Target user (`receiver_user_id`)

  ```json
  {
    "event": "friend_request.received",
    "data": {
      "request_id": 105,
      "sender_id": "12",
      "sender_name": "Ali",
      "sender_avatar_id": 7,
      "created_at": "2026-11-26T10:25:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T10:25:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `request_id` | `int64` | Yes | Friend request record ID |
  | `sender_id` | `string` | Yes | Requester user ID |
  | `sender_name` | `string` | Yes | Requester display name |
  | `sender_avatar_id` | `int64` | No | Omitted if user has no avatar (`0`) |
  | `created_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Request timestamp |

  ---

  ### `friend_request.responded`
  **Trigger:** `PATCH /api/v1/friendships/requests/:id/accept` or `PATCH /api/v1/friendships/requests/:id/reject`
  **Recipient:** Original requester (`requester_user_id`)

  ```json
  {
    "event": "friend_request.responded",
    "data": {
      "request_id": 105,
      "responder_id": "19",
      "responder_avatar_id": 0,
      "responder_name": "Sara",
      "status": "accepted",
      "responded_at": "2026-11-26T10:28:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T10:28:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `request_id` | `int64` | Yes | Friend request record ID |
  | `responder_id` | `string` | Yes | Responder user ID |
  | `responder_avatar_id` | `int64` | Yes | Responder avatar attachment ID (`0` if unset) |
  | `responder_name` | `string` | Yes | Responder display name |
  | `status` | `string` | Yes | `"accepted"` or `"rejected"` |
  | `responded_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Response timestamp |

  ---

  ## 2. Settlement Events

  ### `settlement.paid`
  **Trigger:** `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/settlements`
  **Recipient:** Creditor user (`to_member.user_id`)

  ```json
  {
    "event": "settlement.paid",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "settlement_id": 44,
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "debtor_id": "12",
      "debtor_name": "Ali",
      "creditor_id": "19",
      "creditor_name": "Sara",
      "amount_toman": 250000,
      "settled_at": "2026-11-26T11:00:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T11:00:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `settlement_id` | `int64` | Yes | Settlement ID |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `debtor_id` | `string` | Yes | Payer user ID |
  | `debtor_name` | `string` | Yes | Payer display name |
  | `creditor_id` | `string` | Yes | Recipient user ID |
  | `creditor_name` | `string` | Yes | Recipient display name |
  | `amount_toman` | `int64` | Yes | Settlement amount in Toman |
  | `settled_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Payment timestamp |

  ---

  ## 3. Poll Events

  ### `poll.created`
  **Trigger:** `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/polls`
  **Recipient:** All active group members

  ```json
  {
    "event": "poll.created",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "poll_id": 18,
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "creator_id": "12",
      "creator_name": "Ali",
      "question": "Where should we stay?",
      "options": [
        "Ramsar",
        "Masal"
      ]
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T11:10:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `poll_id` | `int64` | Yes | Poll ID |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `creator_id` | `string` | Yes | Poll creator user ID |
  | `creator_name` | `string` | Yes | Poll creator display name |
  | `question` | `string` | Yes | Poll question |
  | `options` | `string[]` | Yes | Option titles |
  | `expires_at` | `RFC3339` | No | Optional poll expiration timestamp |

  ---

  ### `poll.closed`
  **Trigger:** `PATCH /api/v1/groups/:groupID/polls/:pollID/close`
  **Recipient:** All active group members

  ```json
  {
    "event": "poll.closed",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "poll_id": 18,
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "question": "Where should we stay?",
      "total_votes": 4,
      "results": [
        {
          "option_id": 31,
          "text": "Ramsar",
          "vote_count": 3,
          "percentage": 75
        },
        {
          "option_id": 32,
          "text": "Masal",
          "vote_count": 1,
          "percentage": 25
        }
      ],
      "winning_option": [
        {
          "option_id": 31,
          "text": "Ramsar",
          "vote_count": 3,
          "percentage": 75
        }
      ],
      "closed_at": "2026-11-26T12:00:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:00:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `poll_id` | `int64` | Yes | Poll ID |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `question` | `string` | Yes | Poll question |
  | `total_votes` | `int` | Yes | Total votes cast |
  | `results` | `PollOptionResult[]` | Yes | Tally for each option (`option_id`, `text`, `vote_count`, `percentage`) |
  | `winning_option` | `PollOptionResult[]` | Yes | **Note singular JSON key name:** array of top-voted option(s); empty `[]` if zero votes |
  | `closed_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Close timestamp |

  ---

  ## 4. Lucky Draw Events

  ### `draw.created`
  **Trigger:** `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/draws`
  **Recipient:** All active group members

  ```json
  {
    "event": "draw.created",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "draw_id": 9,
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "creator_id": "12",
      "creator_name": "Ali",
      "title": "Who drives first?",
      "candidates": [
        "Ali",
        "Sara",
        "Bob"
      ],
      "created_at": "2026-11-26T12:10:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:10:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `draw_id` | `int64` | Yes | Draw ID |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `creator_id` | `string` | Yes | Creator user ID |
  | `creator_name` | `string` | Yes | Creator display name |
  | `title` | `string` | Yes | Draw title |
  | `candidates` | `string[]` | Yes | Resolved candidate names/labels |
  | `created_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Creation timestamp |

  ---

  ### `draw.result`
  **Trigger:** `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/draws/:drawID/run` *(only emitted on first completion)*
  **Recipient:** All active group members

  ```json
  {
    "event": "draw.result",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "draw_id": 9,
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "title": "Who drives first?",
      "winner_id": "19",
      "winner_name": "Sara",
      "drawn_at": "2026-11-26T12:12:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:12:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `draw_id` | `int64` | Yes | Draw ID |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `title` | `string` | Yes | Draw title |
  | `winner_id` | `string` | Yes | Winner user ID string, or `""` when the candidate is a free-text entry |
  | `winner_name` | `string` | Yes | Winner display name or text label |
  | `drawn_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Completion timestamp |

  ---

  ## 5. Checklist Events

  ### `checklist.updated`
  **Trigger:**
  * `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/checklist/items`
  * `PUT /api/v1/groups/:groupID/checklist/items/:itemID/claim` *(when state changes)*
  * `DELETE /api/v1/groups/:groupID/checklist/items/:itemID/claim` *(when state changes)*
  * `DELETE /api/v1/groups/:groupID/checklist/items/:itemID`

  **Recipient:** All active group members

  ```json
  {
    "event": "checklist.updated",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "updated_by_id": "12",
      "updated_by_name": "Ali",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-26T12:20:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:20:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `updated_by_id` | `string` | Yes | Acting user ID |
  | `updated_by_name` | `string` | Yes | Acting user display name |
  | `updated_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Change timestamp |

  ---

  ## 6. Admin Report Events

  ### `admin_report.answered`
  **Trigger:** `PUT /api/v1/admin/reports/:id/review` *(when resulting status is `RESOLVED`, `REJECTED`, or `DISMISSED`)*
  **Recipient:** Original reporter

  ```json
  {
    "event": "admin_report.answered",
    "data": {
      "report_id": 31,
      "user_id": "12",
      "subject": "SPAM",
      "answer": "Issue reviewed and resolved.",
      "admin_name": "Sarah Admin",
      "answered_at": "2026-11-26T12:30:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:30:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `report_id` | `int64` | Yes | Report ID |
  | `user_id` | `string` | Yes | Reporter user ID |
  | `subject` | `string` | Yes | Report reason enum string |
  | `answer` | `string` | Yes | Admin response text |
  | `admin_name` | `string` | No | Reviewing admin display name |
  | `answered_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Resolution timestamp |

  ---

  ## 7. Group Membership & Invite Events

  ### `group.member_joined`
  **Trigger:** `POST /api/v1/invites/direct/:inviteID/respond` *(accept)* or `POST /api/v1/invites/links/:token/join`
  **Recipient:** All active group members

  ```json
  {
    "event": "group.member_joined",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "user_id": "23",
      "user_name": "Nima",
      "joined_at": "2026-11-26T12:35:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:35:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `user_id` | `string` | Yes | Joining user ID |
  | `user_name` | `string` | Yes | Joining user display name |
  | `joined_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Join timestamp |

  ---

  ### `group.member_left`
  **Trigger:** `DELETE /api/v1/groups/:groupID/leave` (`reason: "left"`) or `DELETE /api/v1/groups/:groupID/members/:memberID` (`reason: "kicked"`)
  **Recipient:** Remaining active group members (and the kicked user directly when `reason == "kicked"`)

  ```json
  {
    "event": "group.member_left",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "user_id": "23",
      "user_name": "Nima",
      "reason": "kicked",
      "left_at": "2026-11-26T12:40:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:40:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `user_id` | `string` | Yes | Departed/kicked user ID |
  | `user_name` | `string` | Yes | Departed/kicked user display name |
  | `reason` | `string` | No | `"left"` or `"kicked"` |
  | `left_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Departure timestamp |

  ---

  ### `group.invite_received`
  **Trigger:** `POST /api/v1/invites/direct`
  **Recipient:** Invited user(s)

  ```json
  {
    "event": "group.invite_received",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "invite_id": 71,
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "sender_id": "12",
      "sender_name": "Ali",
      "sender_avatar_id": 7,
      "invited_at": "2026-11-26T12:45:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:45:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `invite_id` | `int64` | Yes | Direct invite ID |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `sender_id` | `string` | Yes | Inviter user ID |
  | `sender_name` | `string` | Yes | Inviter display name |
  | `sender_avatar_id` | `int64` | No | Omitted if inviter has no avatar (`0`) |
  | `invited_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Invite timestamp |

  ---

  ## 8. Token Price Events

  ### `token.price_updated`
  **Trigger:** `PUT /api/v1/admin/token-price` *(only emitted when the price value changes)*
  **Recipient:** All connected sessions (`Broadcast`, including anonymous connections if enabled; **not** persisted in `notifications` table)

  ```json
  {
    "event": "token.price_updated",
    "data": {
      "new_price_toman": 12500,
      "old_price_toman": 10000,
      "updated_at": "2026-11-26T12:50:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:50:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `new_price_toman` | `int64` | Yes | Updated token price in Toman |
  | `old_price_toman` | `int64` | Yes | Previous token price in Toman |
  | `updated_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Update timestamp |

  ---

  ## 9. Group Announcement Events

  ### `group.announcement`
  **Trigger:** `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/announcements`
  **Recipient:** Active group members *(excluding the group owner)*

  ```json
  {
    "event": "group.announcement",
    "channel": "group:5",
    "data": {
      "group_id": 5,
      "group_name": "North Trip",
      "sender_id": "12",
      "sender_name": "Group Owner",
      "title": "Emergency Group Notice",
      "message": "Please review the updated checklist and expense split by tonight.",
      "sent_at": "2026-11-26T12:55:00Z"
    },
    "timestamp": "2026-11-26T12:55:00Z"
  }
  ```

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Group ID |
  | `group_name` | `string` | Yes | Group title |
  | `sender_id` | `string` | Yes | Group owner user ID |
  | `sender_name` | `string` | Yes | `"Group Owner"` |
  | `title` | `string` | Yes | Announcement title |
  | `message` | `string` | Yes | Announcement body |
  | `sent_at` | `RFC3339` | Yes | Dispatch timestamp |
}
